{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113791","id":3084674740,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc633Ga0","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113791","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113791.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113791.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113791","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113791/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113791/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113791/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/78858fd92bb61b8aa0b506afca6a7ce3192021a2","number":113791,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Fix get_dependencies by deferring resolution","user":{"login":"cpl-s-matsuyama","id":26297239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2Mjk3MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26297239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpl-s-matsuyama","html_url":"https://github.com/cpl-s-matsuyama","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpl-s-matsuyama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpl-s-matsuyama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpl-s-matsuyama/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpl-s-matsuyama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpl-s-matsuyama/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpl-s-matsuyama/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpl-s-matsuyama/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpl-s-matsuyama/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpl-s-matsuyama/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR fixes the issue where get_dependencies() would return an empty list in certain cases, as reported in #90643.\r\n\r\nThis is a re-implementation of the fix attempted in #90860, which was subsequently reverted in #91908 due to a regression reported in #91726 (import errors).\r\n\r\nUnlike the previous attempt, this implementation avoids the regression by deferring the dependency resolution. The previous attempt resolved dependencies immediately, which led to the reported import errors. This approach ensures that dependencies are handled safely without interfering with the parsing process.\r\n\r\nI have verified that this solution fixes the original issue (#90643) without causing the regression reported in #91726.\r\n\r\nFixes #90643","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-12-09T08:35:06Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T00:36:18Z","closed_at":"2026-02-26T23:56:42Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4f2504512b231839d1bed04b859d1a4b4b09e6c0","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"cpl-s-matsuyama:gdscript-get-dependencies-deferred","ref":"gdscript-get-dependencies-deferred","repo":{"id":1112787664,"node_id":"R_kgDOQlPK0A","name":"godot","full_name":"cpl-s-matsuyama/godot","own